    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d160">

                <pb facs="0203" n="1037" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1037"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72112A/2981i</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Persia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Caldwell</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-22T18:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1918, 6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>78. Consult British, French, Italian colleagues, report to London and Washington
                    simultaneously recommendations enemy trading and confidential lists with
                    specific reasons. If colleagues disagree, state their varying views with
                    reasons.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
